# --- Keep non-website / sensitive files OUT of the public GitHub Pages site ---
# This repo auto-publishes to visitwatseka.com, so anything committed here is
# PUBLIC. The entries below are local working files that must never publish.

# Separate project that lives in this folder (has its own site + CNAME)
Watseka Community Renewal/

# Sensitive nonprofit documents (member PII, grant paperwork)
Membership Renewal List*.pdf
*Grant*Summary*.pdf
GRANT APP*.pdf

# Working scratch: screenshots, archives, design exports
Screenshot *.png
*.zip

# Full-size source art dropped in the site root (posters, vendor photos, etc).
# These are the originals straight out of Canva and run 15-30 MB each, far too
# big to publish. The web-ready copies live in images/ and are NOT affected by
# these rules, because the leading slash anchors them to the repo root only.
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/StacyBeam

# Local-only working files (NOT published, and NOT backed up to GitHub)
archive/
.claude/

# Work-in-progress page drafts (kept private until ready to publish)
_drafts/

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~
